{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"MISOListItemIcon","kind":"identifier"}],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon"},{"text":" displays a status icon (info, warning, positive, negative) with a predefined asset,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"or a custom neutral icon from a provided image. Each icon type has a semantic color applied automatically","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"based on the current theme.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"An optional notification badge can be attached to neutral icons to indicate additional status.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Status","text":"Status","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/IconStatus"},{"text":" enum defines the available icon variants:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".neutral(asset:badge:)"}]},{"text":": A custom icon from a provided ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"text":" asset, rendered with the default","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"content color. An optional notification badge (small dot) can be displayed at the top-trailing corner.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".positive"}]},{"text":": A predefined checkmark\/confirmation icon with a positive (green) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".info"}]},{"text":": A predefined information icon with an informational (blue) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".warning"}]},{"text":": A predefined warning icon with a warning (yellow\/orange) semantic color.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"This icon uses a two-layer rendering with distinct internal and external shape colors.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".negative"}]},{"text":": A predefined alert\/important icon with a negative (red) semantic color.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"anchor":"Sizes","text":"Sizes","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/Size"},{"text":" enum defines the available sizes:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}]},{"text":": The default size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.sizeAssetMedium"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"}]},{"text":": The largest size, corresponding to the theme’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.sizeAssetLarge"},{"text":" token.","type":"text"}]}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Note:"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" When the icon is embedded in a list item with small size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(via ","type":"text"},{"code":"SwiftUI\/View\/misoListItemSize(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest size","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"regardless of the ","type":"text"},{"code":"size","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" parameter.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Code-samples","text":"Code samples","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Info icon with medium size (default)","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"Something new\")","","    \/\/ Warning icon with large size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"Mobile data almost used\", size: .large)","","    \/\/ Negative icon with medium size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .negative, description: \"Payment failed\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon without badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), descritpion: \"Emails\"))","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon with notification badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), description: \"New emails received\", badge: true))","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    MISOStaticListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Information\"),","        leading: .icon(MISOListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    MISOStaticListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Warning\"),","        trailing: .icon(MISOListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","name":"Since","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"OUDS 3.0.0"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","identifier"